* PF-TIA re-sized under the same rules
* LTspice: File > Open (All files) > this .net > Run.  Keep ptm90.lib in this folder.
* One analysis at a time: un-comment the one you want with ";" removed.
.include ptm90.lib
.temp 35

Vdd vdd 0 dc 1
Cpd in 0 450f
CL out 0 50f
Iin 0 in dc 0 ac 1
Ibp vbp 0 dc 20u
Mdp vbp vbp vdd vdd pmos90 W=2u L=200n AD=0.4p AS=0.4p PD=4.4u PS=4.4u
Cbp vbp vdd 2p
Vb1 vb1 0 dc 543.61m
Rn vdd n 7.2148k
M1 n vb1 in 0 nmos90 W=3.618u L=100n AD=0.7236p AS=0.7236p PD=7.636u PS=7.636u
M2 in n 0 0 nmos90 W=2.682u L=100n AD=0.5363p AS=0.5363p PD=5.763u PS=5.763u
M3 out n 0 0 nmos90 W=5.352u L=100n AD=1.07p AS=1.07p PD=11.1u PS=11.1u
M3b out vbp vdd vdd pmos90 W=27.28u L=200n AD=5.456p AS=5.456p PD=54.96u PS=54.96u
Mf vdd out in 0 nmos90 W=1.268u L=100n AD=0.2536p AS=0.2536p PD=2.936u PS=2.936u

.ac dec 40 1Meg 100G
;.noise V(out) Iin dec 40 1Meg 100G
;.op
;Eye diagram: open the matching _eye.net file instead (transient with a PRBS7 current source).
.meas AC zt0 FIND mag(V(out)) AT 10Meg
.meas AC zpk MAX mag(V(out))
.meas AC f3db WHEN mag(V(out))=zt0/sqrt(2) FALL=1
.backanno
.end
